                        <svg class="gv-ico" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 2v4M10 4h4M4 22V12l8-5 8 5v10M9 22v-5a3 3 0 0 1 6 0v5" /></svg>教會聯絡資訊
                    </h3>
                    <ul class="gv-contact">
                        <li><svg class="gv-ico" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 21s-7-6.2-7-11a7 7 0 0 1 14 0c0 4.8-7 11-7 11z" /><circle cx="12" cy="10" r="2.5" /></svg><span>地址：@churchAddress</span></li>
                        <li><svg class="gv-ico" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 3h4l2 5-2.5 1.5a11 11 0 0 0 6 6L16 13l5 2v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2A16 16 0 0 1 3 5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2z" /></svg><span>電話：@churchPhone</span></li>
                        <li><svg class="gv-ico" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="3" y="5" width="18" height="14" rx="2" /><path d="M3 7l9 6 9-6" /></svg><span>信箱：@churchEmail</span></li>
                        <li><svg class="gv-ico" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="3" y="5" width="18" height="14" rx="2" /><circle cx="9" cy="12" r="2" /><path d="M14 10h4M14 14h4M6 17c0-1.7 1.3-3 3-3s3 1.3 3 3" /></svg><span>統編：@churchTaxId</span></li>
                        <li><svg class="gv-ico" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9" /><path d="M12 11v5M12 8h.01" /></svg><span>若有任何奉獻問題，請洽詢 @churchContactPerson</span></li>
                    </ul>
